<!-- Deliberately defines nothing. The Flutter UI is light-only (MaterialApp in
     lib/main.dart sets no darkTheme), so a dark launch window would flash
     before a light first frame; LaunchTheme and NormalTheme come from values/
     and values-v31/ in dark mode as well. Android resolves each style on its
     own, so an empty file here changes nothing.

     The file is kept rather than deleted because `flutter create .` restores
     missing template files, and the template's Theme.Black styles would
     outrank values-v31/ (the night qualifier beats the API level) and bring
     the flash back. If the app gains a darkTheme, define the night window
     colour here and add a values-night-v31/ splash style to match. -->
